    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="RecipeRules_35">
      <bpmn:text>Recipe validation (FR-BOM-01–14)
Target: product variant or supported cake option.
Multiple existing base inventory ingredients with positive quantities and correct units.
Use each ingredient once per definition; other recipes may use it too.
No nested recipes or intermediate/prepared inventory.
Owner alone edits; Staff views only.
Check current record/version.
Stock/cost shortage is not a reason to invent recipe quantities or auto-change final price.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Assoc_RecipeRules_35" sourceRef="Validate_35" targetRef="RecipeRules_35" associationDirection="None" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Reuse_35">
      <bpmn:text>Separate consumer processes
BPMN-22: material planning.
BPMN-09/11: applicable reservations.
BPMN-13: production reference/consumption.
BPMN-36: costing/final-price approval.
BPMN-33: catalog/variant maintenance.
BPMN-26: authentication precondition.
Saving a recipe does not execute these processes or move stock.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Assoc_Reuse_35" sourceRef="Available_35" targetRef="Reuse_35" associationDirection="None" />
